      },
      "text": "VIP Tour of Chile, Bolivia and Peru"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:lead:e3456bc1f4d270f4",
      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "957e96ed6ddd6cf2376725c5052b02b7496066bd1df9dbed9c6018ef5c8a71c0",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-worker-bde0f3741f24400e07188c41",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "This trip brings together three countries and some very different South American landscapes. From Santiago, head to the Atacama Desert to see the Valley of the Moon and the night sky over the desert. Cross the Bolivian highlands, passing colorful lagoons, geysers and the Uyuni Salt Flat, then visit La Paz and Lake Titicaca. Continue through Peru to Cusco, Machu Picchu and the Sacred Valley."
    },
